					"nextDialogs": [
						722640522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640522,
					"content": "嗯…那今天就到这里吧。吉法师也累了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640523,
					"content": "嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「吉法师」"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640524,
					"content": "那我们回去向五百藏报告吧。毕竟，五百藏感觉还挺担心的。",
