					"speakerTitle": "五百藏"
				},
				{
					"id": 722640624,
					"content": "和吉法师旅行很有趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722640627
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722640627,
					"content": "呶，很好。那接下来也交给你们了。",
